    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know but i really dont want to go. i'm pretty sure it's just stress and tension. if i take a couple of some pretty strong ibuprofen and maybe some of my prescription migraine meds my doctor gave me last year, wouldn't that just handle it? i'm fine as long as the pain goes down, right? it's probably fine to just wait until morning to see if it stays this bad.",
